overview/results	| Measured | Without KAPU | With KAPU | |---|---|---| | Claude Sonnet, PLC manuals of six vendors, 60 questions, three runs | one Markdown file with grep: $1.85, 92% of the answerable ones fully correct | **$1.42**, 91% fully correct | | 25 of those questions in one session, one run | one Markdown file with grep: $0.72, 19 of 20 fully correct | **$0.58**, 17 of 20 fully correct | | The same manuals, 36 questions, nothing to look it up in | Claude Sonnet alone: 28% correct |	
